# sha256 of every file the analysis reads as input.
#
# The six data and genome files are what notebooks 02-06 depend on. The KEGG pathway
# files are not listed: they are downloaded at render time, and their checksums
# are recorded in tag-seq/genome/kegg_one_SOURCE.txt instead.
# Nothing derived is listed here -- derived files are tracked in git and diffed after a
# render instead.
#
# Checked automatically by verify_inputs() in tag-seq/code/_common.R at the start of every
# render; a mismatch warns, it does not stop. Check by hand with:
#     shasum -c CHECKSUMS.sha256
# Re-record after a deliberate data change with:
#     shasum -a 256 $(awk '!/^#/ && NF {print $2}' CHECKSUMS.sha256) > CHECKSUMS.sha256
